320 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 157 0 R
/E (The Agentic Data Analysis Assistant aims to simplify the data analysis process by allowing users to interact with CSV datasets through natural-language queries instead of writing code manually. By combining Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct and LangChain with Python libraries such as Pandas, NumPy and Matplotlib, the system is designed to automate dataset inspection, statistical analysis and data visualisation. It uses predefined tools and input validation to ensure controlled and safer execution. Overall, this project demonstrates how AI agents can make data analysis faster, easier and more accessible to users, including those without advanced programming knowledge.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
